WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Some questions need more than an answer.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Ember. A question becomes a lesson.

00:08.000 --> 00:14.000
Bring a question. Solve x + 2 = 5.
Prepared demonstration, edited for length.

00:14.000 --> 00:18.000
See why each step works. x + 2 = 5.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Subtract 2 from both sides: x + 2 − 2 = 5 − 2.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
x = 3.

00:28.000 --> 00:35.000
Go back to the moment it clicks.
Revisit the subtract-2 chapter.

00:35.000 --> 00:38.000
And ask the next question.
Prepared Office Hours example.

00:38.000 --> 00:43.000
Why subtract 2 from both sides? To keep the two sides equal.
Subtracting 2 undoes the + 2, so x is left on its own.

00:43.000 --> 00:48.000
More questions. Same workspace.
Gallery subjects and the built-in Calculus sample.

00:48.000 --> 00:52.000
Ember. Every problem, a lesson.
Create your first lesson.
